==Strategy==
This stage is tough without [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Blockers]], but isn't too difficult. You'll want to use a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] in addition to a unit with high damage. If you have all the [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from all 3 chapters, this stage becomes much easier. If you want, you can try to rush the stage with units who can kill the first few foes quickly, or you can stall for money and fight the whole enemy army after you've prepared.

